<section class="section cream"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow orange">Signature Implementation</div><h2 class="section-title">The Growth<br>Terrain Build</h2></div><div class="copy" style="align-self:end">We begin with recon, map the route, deploy the infrastructure, and refine the system as the business climbs.</div></div><div class="build-grid"><article class="build-card"><small>Basic Build</small><div class="price">From $5,495</div><p>Focused implementation of the highest-priority revenue and customer-flow infrastructure identified in recon.</p></article><article class="build-card dark-card"><small>Full Stack Build</small><div class="price">From $10,495</div><p>A broader connected system spanning intake, CRM, pipeline, follow-up, automation, communications, reporting, and team ownership.</p></article></div><p class="fineprint">XGL builds are tailored to the terrain of each organization. Published prices are starting reference investments, not universal quotations. Final scope, deliverables, schedule, third-party costs, ongoing services, and investment are established after the Growth Terrain Assessment and confirmed in a written proposal.</p><a class="button" href="/assessment">Map Your Growth Terrain</a></div></section>
